flowchart TD
  Dashboard --> Boundary[Loopback binding, Host and Origin checks]
  Boundary --> Auth[Per-run token authentication]
  Auth --> REST[REST /api routes]
  Auth --> WS[WebSocket /ws subprotocol token auth]
  REST --> Runtime[application.Runtime]
  WS <--> Events[Initial snapshot and bounded event queue]
  Events <--> Runtime
  Runtime --> Repositories[SQLite repositories]
  Runtime --> Halts[Halt manager]
  Runtime --> OS[Explicit Windows proxy and CA actions]
